In some ways, {lo cinfo} is to {lo ka ce'u cinfo} as {lo nu da cinfo} is to {lo 
du'u da cinfo}. The "lo" and "lo nu" exist in spacetime, and the "lo ka" and "lo 
du'u" don't. "lo'i ka" and "lo'i du'u" are singletons, and "lo'i (cinfo)" and 
"lo'i nu" aren't.

